<reference id="bacnet-BacnetEnumProxyExt" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">Proxy Ext (bacnet-BacnetEnumProxyExt)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component handles multistate values in a BACnet device,
